    "body": "Stopping on Step 7 and removing `claimed` because the local `sccache` WebDAV endpoint is unreachable on this host, blocking `cargo clippy` and `cargo xtask gate quick`.\n\n### Cause and Fix (staged locally, not pushed)\n- **Cause:** `machining2d::rest_pocket` passed `plan.center` (`plan.rest.offset(r + REST_REACH).intersect(&own_center)`) directly to `pocket_over`, so `waterline_passes` walked closed rings around both the corner wall and the cleared-floor inner side (`r + 0.05 mm` from `plan.rest`), and `previous_stock_to_leave > 0` walked pure-air CW hole loops over cleared floor.\n- **Fix (staged in `.claude/worktrees/issue-1816` on branch `issue/1816-rest-corner-air` stacked on `f4c9f1ea` / `#1817`):**\n  - `crates/motion/src/machining2d/rest_rings.rs` (`rest_passes`): clips concentric rings against `cut_zone = plan.rest.offset(r + REST_REACH * 0.5)` while keeping `plan.center` for entry/links, and chains surviving open/closed pieces interior-out.\n  - `crates/motion/src/machining2d/rest_anchor.rs` (`anchor_first_pass`): re-anchors an open first pass started on a pinched tip back into nearby dive room so axial plunge links stay inside rest material.\n  - `crates/motion/src/machining2d/pocket_emit.rs` (`PocketWalks`, `emit_pocket_passes`): shared pass emission extracted from `pocket.rs`.\n  - `crates/motion/src/machining2d/rest2d.rs`: routes `plan.previous_fits` through `rest_passes` + `emit_pocket_passes`.\n  - `crates/app/tests/golden/pocket_rest_corners.cl`: updated golden (`moves=84`, 86 lines; down from `moves=126`).\n  - `docs/decisions/1816-rest-corner-air.md`: decision record added.\n\n### Verification before `sccache` outage vs current blocker\n- **Pins verified red before fix:** `crates/app/tests/rest_pocket.rs` (`read_against_the_simulated_roughing_pass`, `6.724–6.725 mm` per corner across 8 runs) and `crates/motion/tests/rest2d.rs` (`rest_rings_do_not_feed_over_cleared_floor`, `26.90 mm` cleared-floor feed). Added `deep_corner_and_filleted_turns_clear_residue_without_cleared_floor_laps` and `previous_stock_to_leave_drops_cleared_floor_hole_lap`.\n- **Mutations verified before outage:** reverting `rest2d.rs` to `pocket_over` failed 3 pins (`26.90 mm`, `51.30 mm`, `174.34 mm`), restored green; disabling `anchor_first_pass` failed `rest_rings_do_not_feed_over_cleared_floor` (`1.26 mm`), restored green.\n- **Targeted suites before outage:** `camcraft-motion --test rest2d` passed (13/13) and `camcraft-app --test rest_pocket` passed (6/6).\n- **Current blocker:** `cargo clippy --manifest-path .claude/worktrees/issue-1816/Cargo.toml -p camcraft-motion -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings`, `cargo test`, and `cargo run --manifest-path .claude/worktrees/issue-1816/Cargo.toml -p xtask -- gate quick --base upstream/main` all fail at `/home/mikekinney/.local/bin/sccache` startup (`http://192.168.50.11:9000/.sccache_check`: `tcp connect error: Network unreachable (os error 101)`), both sandboxed and unsandboxed. Once `192.168.50.11:9000` is back up, `.claude/worktrees/issue-1816` is ready to run clippy + `xtask gate quick` and push.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
